[main-thx-about-title]About Quenching
[main-thx-about-dis]This is a Warcraft Reforged enhancement mod created by [天下正义]\nThanks to the support from the community and Warcraft enthusiasts\nWe received significant support in HTML UI and shader aspects\n\nThis is an open-source project under the cc4.0 license\nYou can not only enjoy it for free but also use the materials with attribution\n\nDue to financial and personal pressures, we can only work on it in our spare time\nYour support is very important to us
[main-thx-about-pay1]WeChat Donation
[main-thx-about-pay2]Alipay Donation
[main-thx-support-title]- Support -
[main-thx-support-dis]Blizzard Classic Team\nThey contributed most of the code\nWithout them, this MOD wouldn't be possible\n\nBlizzard NetEase\nFor use and broadcasting in tournaments\n\nBack2Warcraft\nUses the MOD to broadcast international tournaments\nAlso, many thanks for their generous donation\n\nYumiko\nUses the MOD in live gameplay\nOne of our earliest supporters\n\nQiaolin\nUses the MOD to broadcast events\nHelps with recommendations and promotions
[main-thx-thx]- Thanks -
[main-thx-thx-dis]Due to the large number of contributors\nWe will move this list to the website\n\nThe new homepage is expected to be online in May\nPlease check if your name is listed\n\nIf any omission is found\nOr if you would like to change how your name is displayed\nPlease contact us as soon as possible
[main-thx-cc40]Can be used commercially, but please prominently credit [Quenching] [天下正义] and the product icon
