[changeable-cos-hero-name]Original
[changeable-cos-orc-unit-1]Glory of the Horde
[changeable-cos-orc-unit-1-dis]Five Orc warriors receive an enhanced appearance\nto help the Horde in their conquests
[changeable-cos-hum-unit-1]Alliance Elite
[changeable-cos-hum-unit-1-dis]Replace models of five different Alliance soldiers\nReady for the battle of Azeroth
[changeable-cos-disable]Locked
[changeable-cos-disable-dis]This warband skin is currently unavailable\nPlease choose another
[changeable-set-unit]Unit Changes
[changeable-set-unit-dis]Various adjustments to unit models\nSkins will be unavailable if disabled
[changeable-set-tree]Environment Transformation
[changeable-set-tree-dis]More delicate textures and models\nChoose different versions of resources
[changeable-set-vio]International Graphics
[changeable-set-vio-dis]Some regions disable adult effects\nUnlock to experience full Reforged graphics
[changeable-set-water]Water Surface
[changeable-set-water-dis]Switch between two types of water\nDistorted perspective or bloom effect
[changeable-set-foli]Foliage
[changeable-set-foli-dis]Lush foliage may cause lag\nChoose based on your hardware
[changeable-set-shader]Advanced Shaders
[changeable-set-shader-dis]Optimized graphics adjustments\nAchieve enhanced visuals
[changeable-set-light]Global Lighting
[changeable-set-light-dis]Significant optimization of ambient lighting\nBrighter and clearer visuals
[changeable-set-ld]Light Source Direction
[changeable-set-ld-dis]Light source affects shadow and day-night transitions\nCan be fixed or rotating
[changeable-set-tile]Terrain Environment
[changeable-set-tile-dis]Comprehensive changes to textures and lighting\nProvides fresh visual effects
[changeable-set-ui-1]Classic UI
[changeable-set-ui-1-dis]Larger icons and mini-maps\nCompatible with all RPG maps
[changeable-set-ui-3]Quenching UI
[changeable-set-ui-3-dis]Wider field of vision\nStreamlined UI design\nMinimal operational changes
[changeable-set-ui-2]Carnival UI
[changeable-set-ui-2-dis]Less visual obstruction\nSpecial portrait style\nMajor operational changes
[changeable-set-glow]Hero Glow
[changeable-set-glow-dis]Simplified smaller glow around heroes\nMore suited for RPG map style
[changeable-set-half]Half-body Portrait
[changeable-set-half-dis]Carnival style portrait files\nNot suitable for classic UI
