[changeable-thx-1]- Blizzard Classic Team -\nThey contributed most of the code\nWithout them, this MOD wouldn't be possible\n\n- Blizzard NetEase -\nFor use and broadcasting in tournaments\n\n- Back2Warcraft -\nUses the MOD to broadcast international tournaments\nAlso, many thanks for their generous donation\n\n- Yumiko -\nUses the MOD in live gameplay\nOne of our earliest supporters\n\n- Qiaolin -\nUses the MOD to broadcast events\nHelps with recommendations and promotions\n
[changeable-thx-2]- Frost Duke -\nProvided anti-censorship methods\nHelped with client testing tools\n\n- CodeXL -\nProvided shader editing materials\n\n- Reteras\Magos -\nProvided model simplification tools\n\n- Blender -\nEnabled further model modifications\n\n- Tasyen -\nProvided numerous fdf modification tutorials\n\n- WardenIO -\nProvided code for HD modules
[changeable-thx-3]- Ladik -\nProvided Casc file cracking method\n\n- Nvtt -\nProvided DDS image processing software\n\n- Wanderbraun -\nRecommended our MOD to Russian friends\n\n- Rey Gaming -\nContinuously provides MOD match videos on YouTube\n\n- Warglaive -\nContinuously provides MOD videos to Spanish community\n\n- Daniel Sadowski -\nProvided music for us
[changeable-thx-4]- Official Forum -\nSaido, taichi, pat, dingo\nContinuously updates our status on official forum\n\n- Community Managers -\n呜喵王, 大叔, 白羽, hahatgj, 逆鳞, 大哥\nProvides continuous community management\n\n- Chinese Promotion -\n星星哥/格瓦斯劳斯基/依瑞斯/斯美拉琪海露\n战术TNT/WRY魔兽联盟/平川电竞/冰糖解说\n\n- Kam -\nInternational community KOL
[changeable-thx-5]- wTc -\nReddit promotion\n\n- Hiveworkshop -\nProvides resources and website collaboration\n\n- Campaign Partner -\nCSW Team/InsaneMonster/Tomoraider\n\n- Chinese Campaign Partner -\n记忆/鬼画桃符\n蓝蓝子/淬火粉丝/织星人\n\n- Warcraft Intelligence Bureau -\nProvides MOD coverage and organizes competitions
[changeable-thx-6]- Vulfat -\nProvided hero and warband skins\n\n- Andreiki -\nRussian translator\n\n- Campaign Code -\n幻想的仪式/杰克川\n\n- Test -\n安林喵/是甜食哇/无可救药的废萌\n暗夜鱼人艾琳/Scream放点盐/成都第二菜包子\n\n- Wfz -\nProvides MOD campaign guides
[changeable-thx-7]- Coding.net -\nProvides cloud service\n\n- Fenix Gaming -\nMOD livestream in Spanish community\n\n- Ralle -\nProvides dedicated support on Hive\n\n- Russian Promotion -\nArrow's Path/PavellGameChannel\n\n- Other Models -\nMystic/Xyrohn21/Malmgreva\n\n*If you were missing, please contact us*
